    "title": "Compose Material Catalog",
    "description": "A canonical reference of Material Design components, theming, dark theme, and how to implement these features in Jetpack Compose: the Compose Material Catalog. The catalog consists of three main screens: the home screen, the component screen, and the example screen. At any point you can launch the theme picker or \u201cmore\u201d menu from the top app bar. The app also supports dark theme.",
